        <mxCell id="uvQYUA6P2yuay3lXrDvk-119" parent="uvQYUA6P2yuay3lXrDvk-115" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FLASH_NV page 22&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reads copy only the field then &lt;b&gt;ForceZero&lt;/b&gt;. Writes RMW the 8 KB page, program, wipe. Pairing priv / ML-DSA SK are not loaded on OTP / peer / KEM-PUB paths.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;secure_dwk&lt;/b&gt; keys Tropic R-MEM AEAD, PIN pepper, ML-KEM KEK salt, SHA-384(dwk || password) — not an NV seal. Erased / unknown magic → empty. No v3–v6 migrate.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
